Package: app-encloser
Version: 1.0.4
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1, bubblewrap, binutils
Recommends: squashfs-tools
Maintainer: MD Shahriar Rezowan Resad <mdsrresad@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/mdsrresad/app-encloser
Description: Isolated Portable Application & Package Manager
 App Encloser encloses Linux application packages (.deb, .AppImage, .tar.gz, etc.)
 into self-contained user directories with private configurations, zero background
 daemons, zero root requirements, and optional Bubblewrap filesystem sandboxing.
